{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50662","headline":"朱槿花 · 薛涛","name":"朱槿花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红开露脸误文君，□□芙蓉草绿云。\n（张篷舟《薛涛诗笺》谓北京图书馆藏宋本《分门纂类唐歌诗》，此句无缺文，作「司蒡芙蓉草绿云」。\n）造化大都排比巧，衣裳色泽总薰薰。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛涛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50662.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50662","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}